            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Side A 0.5.50

- Less work while sessions are streaming, and much faster checks with Codex sessions open.
- Quit and Quit Idle no longer end a session that just got work from your iPhone.
- Large photos from your iPhone over a slow connection are no longer cut off.
- The Sessions window and the island answer questions the same way; ⌃⌥N on a plan opens "What should change?".
- Fixes for Codex usage under added accounts, Claude settings with non-English text, and indexing.

macOS 14 or later. Apple Silicon and Intel. Free.
]]></description>
